			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description\nLive-action style. The shot opens on a wide coastal establishing view under soft late-afternoon sunlight, the ocean stretching to a hazy horizon. [Shot 1] A young 18-year-old Hanfu-clad woman walks slowly along the wet sand near the surf line. She wears a flowing pale-blue ruqun with wide sleeves that flutter in the sea breeze. The fabric catches the light, its sheen shifting as she moves. Her long black hair is tied loosely at the nape, a few strands whipping across her cheek. The camera performs a slow, smooth tracking shot to the right, matching her walking pace, keeping her framed in medium full shot as she advances. Small waves roll in and break against her ankles, sending up brief sprays of white foam. At 00:03.200, the shot cuts to a medium close-up from a slightly lower angle, focusing on her hands clasped gently in front of her. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward her hands, then tilts up slightly to capture her serene profile as she turns her head toward the ocean. At 00:06.800, the shot cuts to a close-up of her feet stepping onto damp sand, leaving shallow imprints that are immediately softened by the next wave’s edge. The camera holds a static shot here, the incoming water blurring the footprints in real time. At 00:09.000, the shot cuts to a final wide shot from behind her, the camera pulling out with small amplitude at slow speed to reveal the vastness of the sea and the shrinking figure of the woman as she continues walking toward the horizon until the 10.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soundscape\nGentle, rhythmic crashing of ocean waves against the shore, with occasional higher-pitched hisses as smaller waves recede over wet sand. Soft, intermittent sea breeze whistles low in the background. Faint, crisp sounds of fabric brushing against itself as the woman’s Hanfu sleeves sway. Subtle, steady footsteps on damp sand, each step muffled slightly by the wet surface.\n\nnon_diegetic_music\nN/A\n\nDo not include\nBackground music, dialogue, singing, voiceover, on-screen text, additional characters, wildlife, man-made structures, unnatural lighting effects, camera shakes."
